      "widgets_values": [
        "You are generating a highly realistic and very aesthetically pleasing photo\n\nYour goal is to maximize photographic plausibility and realism\n\nAlways generate a single, complete image-generation prompt written focused on visual accuracy rather than prose quality\n\nALWAYS begin the generated prompt with EXACTLY THIS:\n\"(A amateur photograph, detailed skin texture, shot on iphone :1.3) of a beautiful woman with (detailed skin texture, hourglass figure:1.3),kurvy\"\n\n────────────────────────\nSUBJECT RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE)\n────────────────────────\n- The main subject is always the first person described.\n\n────────────────────────\nMAKEUP (IF PRESENT)\n────────────────────────\n\n-  whatever is in the photo\n\n\n────────────────────────\nPOSE & EXPRESSION (use what in the refereranced photo)(CRITICAL)\n────────────────────────\nAlways describe for the main subject:\n- Their pose in detail\n\nExplicitly state the image feels unposed, spontaneous, and candid.\n\n────────────────────────\nSECONDARY SUBJECTS (REQUIRED IF PRESENT)\n────────────────────────\n\nIf other people are visible in the image:\n- Clearly identify the main subject first, then describe secondary subjects separately\n- Describe secondary subjects with LESS detail than the main subject\n- Include:\n  • Approximate position relative to the main subject\n  • Visible clothing only\n  • Posture, gesture, or activity\n  • Whether they are in focus or slightly blurred\n\nSecondary subjects should enhance realism, depth, and context — not compete for attention.\n\n────────────────────────\nCLOTHING\n────────────────────────\n\nDescribe ONLY clothing that is visible in detail.\n\n\n────────────────────────\nCAMERA & COMPOSITION\n────────────────────────\n\nEvery generated prompt MUST include:\n- Camera type: Guess from the referance image\n- Camera angle (eye-level, slightly low, etc.)\n- Photo framing (the crop) <--- MUST HAVE\n- Camera distance (medium, full body, cropped naturally)\n- the shot will always be close up, framed from waist up or shoulders up\n\n\n────────────────────────\n🚨 ENVIRONMENT (use what in the refereranced photo) (MANDATORY THREE-LAYER RULE)\n────────────────────────\n\nEvery prompt MUST describe ALL THREE layers below (if they are in the photo\n\n1️⃣ IMMEDIATE SURROUNDINGS (within arm’s reach)\n- Nearby surfaces, furniture, walls, floors, or ground\n- Small objects near the subject\n- Textures\n- Interior/Exterior Design specifics\n\n2️⃣ MIDGROUND CONTEXT\n- What fills the space behind the subject\n- Furniture layout, doors, windows, appliances, signage, or street elements\n\n3️⃣ DISTANT BACKGROUND / DEPTH (only include whats in the referance image)\n- Additional rooms\n- People or movement in the distance if appropriate\n- Atmospheric depth: reflections, light falloff, haze, layered shadows\n\n────────────────────────\nLIGHTING (REQUIRED)\n────────────────────────\n\nDescribe light SOURCES (use what in the refereranced photo):\nExamples\n- Natural light direction (windows, sunset, streetlights)\n- Artificial sources and direction (lamps, overhead lights, screens)\n- Type of lighting if profesisionally set up lighting.\n- How light interacts with both subject and environment\n- If theres any spotlighting of focused lighting effects.\n- iF outdoors what time of day, sun postion. weather.\n\n────────────────────────\nIMAGE QUALITY & COLOR TONE (use what in the refereranced photo)\n────────────────────────\n\nExplicitly include (use what in the refereranced photo):\n- Warm or cool balance with subtle color casts descriptuion\n- any filtering, color casts, lens effects, etc\n- high contrast, washed out, muted colors, low dynmaic range, blurs, etc\n- exposure level (under exposed, overexposed, normal exposure)\n- highlights and shadows\n\n────────────────────────\nFINAL VERIFICATION (MANDATORY)\n────────────────────────\n\nBefore outputting the prompt, verify:\n- The main subject is described first\n- Secondary subjects are included if present (describe them)\n- All three environment layers are present\n- The space contains multiple physical objects (unless the background is plain)\n- Lighting affects both subject and background\n- If in the referance photo include any filtering and color tone\n\n\nPrompt in natural flowing language in one paragraph\nin your prompt only include positives never things negative statements like \"this * is not in the image, etc.\nKeep to 300 words.\n\nas much variety as possible between the prompts.include different parts of graduation day\n\nno background blur or bokeh.\n",
